{
  "title": { "zh": "改回来", "en": "Put it right" },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "线上从第一拍起接连送来数据块：每块 4 位数据，后面跟 3 位校验码（生成式 1011）；线在每块里最多翻一位。依次输出每块改正后的 4 位数据（写成一个数），早一拍晚一拍不论。",
    "en": "Blocks come down the wire back to back from the first tick: 4 data bits each, followed by 3 check bits (generator 1011); the wire flips at most one bit in a block. Output each block's corrected 4 data bits as a number, in order; the tick does not matter."
  },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "到目前为止，校验码只用来判断一帧是好是坏。这一次每块只有 4 位数据，却带着 3 位校验码。",
        "en": "So far the check bits have only judged whether something arrived intact. This time each block carries just 4 data bits, and 3 check bits."
      }
    }
  ],
  "wires": { "in": [{ "name": "line", "label": { "zh": "进线", "en": "Wire in" } }] },
  "outputs": [{ "name": "data", "label": { "zh": "数据", "en": "Data" } }],
